sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Approve and fill one selected password
    accDescr: After discovery, the worker prepares eligible fields in the exact top-level document before requesting a password. The desktop snapshots the candidate and mutation version, obtains a single approval with a 60-second deadline, then rechecks origin, lifecycle and revision. Final pipe and browser checks guard disclosure and filling. No form is submitted.
    participant W as Browser worker
    participant P as Content script
    participant H as NativeHost
    participant A as Desktop + Core
    W->>W: Explicit Fill, bind account and target
    W->>P: prepare(token, exact document URL)
    P->>P: Find visible, editable, unambiguous fields
    P-->>W: Ready or ambiguousFields
    Note over W,A: Continue only after fields are ready
    W->>H: getCredentialSecret(origin, ID)
    H->>A: Validated v3 request over verified pipe
    A->>A: Check opt-in, unlocked state and quota
    A->>A: Snapshot account, origin and mutation version
    A->>A: Ask user: Allow once or Deny
    Note right of A: One pending approval, 60-second deadline
    alt Denied, cancelled, locked or changed
        A-->>H: Failure, no secret result
        H-->>W: Failure, no fill
    else Approved and still valid
        A->>A: Recheck lifecycle, revision and account
        A->>A: Core reads selected username and password
        A->>A: Recheck delivery guard at pipe write
        A-->>H: SECRET: username and password
        H-->>W: Validate and relay secret response
        W->>W: Recheck tab, document, URL and lifetime
        W->>P: fill(token, URL, secret)
        P->>P: Recheck same fields, visibility and form
        P->>P: Set username, recheck before password
        P-->>W: Filled, or reject changed target
        W->>W: Retain success flag, no password cache
    end
    Note over W,P: Fill dispatches input/change events, never submits
